flowchart TD
 A([Start]) --> B[Select active campaign and enter amount]
 B --> C{Input valid?}
 C -->|No| D[Show validation error] --> B
 C -->|Yes| E[Create pending donation and attempt]
 E --> F{Demo result}
 F -->|Success| G[Mark successful and update campaign]
 G --> H[Create unique receipt and audit event] --> I([Show successful result])
 F -->|Failure| J[Mark failed; no receipt] --> K([Show failed result / retry])
